      "comment": "COMPTON AVA (1) was out of the placings last time when fifth at this track (27.02) but scored four back at Mt Gambier (29.89). Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from three starts. Has claims if she runs up to expectations. DOLLY'S MY MUM (5) finished fourth last time at this track but could not have been more impressive before that in her head turning 17.36 win at Mt Gambier over 305m. Top win two back and can measure up again. HERE COMES RHEA (7) was well supported last time but could only manage second (31.12), beaten 4.5 lengths. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Expecting another good run. VICTA HOWARD (3) is in winning form and worth including in the main hopes.",
